  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "もとは　ひとつだったと　いわれる\nキュレムと　あるポケモンを\nがったいさせる　いっついの　くさび。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "원래는 하나였다고 전해지는\n큐레무와 어떤 포켓몬을\n합체시키는 한 쌍의 쐐기.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓據說原是一體的酋雷姆和\n某寶可夢合體的一對楔子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un outil qui permet la fusiorption de Kyurem\net d’un autre Pokémon avec lequel il ne faisait\nqu’un à l’origine.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Keil, der Kyurem und ein gewisses anderes\nPokémon, die vermeintlich einst eins gewesen sind,\nvereinigt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Punta que permite fusionar a Kyurem con cierto\nPokémon con el que, originariamente, formaba\nun solo ser.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuneo che permette di fondere Kyurem con il\nPokémon al quale era unito in origine.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A splicer that fuses Kyurem and a certain Pokémon.\nThey are said to have been one in the beginning.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "元は　ひとつだったと　いわれる\nキュレムと　あるポケモンを\n合体させる　一対の　くさび。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "据说是能让原本为一体的\n酋雷姆和某宝可梦\n合体的一对楔子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
